    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/482dd23e9277fe89123a3ac051fd53d4.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, folks, listen up! Step into the Arenas and snatch up every bit of loot you can! Your goal? Make it to the exit\u2014team up with your fellow contestants or go it alone if you've got the guts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/2cf874a46dde69e4ff0b2209f7794d0f.poster.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/2cf874a46dde69e4ff0b2209f7794d0f.webm?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/2cf874a46dde69e4ff0b2209f7794d0f.mp4?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t get too cozy\u2014there\u2019s spike traps, fire traps, and our very own \u2018employees\u2019 just dying to make your run unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/151fd84031464de5a863533756e2a5dc.poster.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/151fd84031464de5a863533756e2a5dc.webm?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/151fd84031464de5a863533756e2a5dc.mp4?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, don\u2019t worry too much; we\u2019ve got sponsors and a shop with just enough gear to boost your survival odds\u2026 if you\u2019ve got the cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/bc58500da5cb186fe108b7f96db0197b.poster.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/bc58500da5cb186fe108b7f96db0197b.webm?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/bc58500da5cb186fe108b7f96db0197b.mp4?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round, the stakes get higher, and so do the rewards. You\u2019ll need those rewards to deck out your Greenroom with all kinds of, let\u2019s say, unique decor. Good luck, you\u2019re gonna need it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/7be393f05983ba159113b8328c0494dd.poster.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/7be393f05983ba159113b8328c0494dd.webm?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/7be393f05983ba159113b8328c0494dd.mp4?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would a gameshow be without Bonus Rounds?!\u00a0<br>Complete the challenges to win some extra cash! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/87d32b6bc1e4071b1c044a051271a50e.poster.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/87d32b6bc1e4071b1c044a051271a50e.webm?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/87d32b6bc1e4071b1c044a051271a50e.mp4?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/482dd23e9277fe89123a3ac051fd53d4.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, folks, listen up! Step into the Arenas and snatch up every bit of loot you can! Your goal? Make it to the exit\u2014team up with your fellow contestants or go it alone if you've got the guts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/2cf874a46dde69e4ff0b2209f7794d0f.poster.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/2cf874a46dde69e4ff0b2209f7794d0f.webm?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/2cf874a46dde69e4ff0b2209f7794d0f.mp4?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t get too cozy\u2014there\u2019s spike traps, fire traps, and our very own \u2018employees\u2019 just dying to make your run unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/151fd84031464de5a863533756e2a5dc.poster.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/151fd84031464de5a863533756e2a5dc.webm?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/151fd84031464de5a863533756e2a5dc.mp4?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, don\u2019t worry too much; we\u2019ve got sponsors and a shop with just enough gear to boost your survival odds\u2026 if you\u2019ve got the cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/bc58500da5cb186fe108b7f96db0197b.poster.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/bc58500da5cb186fe108b7f96db0197b.webm?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/bc58500da5cb186fe108b7f96db0197b.mp4?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round, the stakes get higher, and so do the rewards. You\u2019ll need those rewards to deck out your Greenroom with all kinds of, let\u2019s say, unique decor. Good luck, you\u2019re gonna need it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/7be393f05983ba159113b8328c0494dd.poster.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/7be393f05983ba159113b8328c0494dd.webm?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/7be393f05983ba159113b8328c0494dd.mp4?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would a gameshow be without Bonus Rounds?!\u00a0<br>Complete the challenges to win some extra cash! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/87d32b6bc1e4071b1c044a051271a50e.poster.avif?t=1753817960\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/87d32b6bc1e4071b1c044a051271a50e.webm?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750480/extras/87d32b6bc1e4071b1c044a051271a50e.mp4?t=1753817960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "7 Minutes in Hell is a co-operative horror game, where 1-4 contestants must face Arenas filled with traps and monsters. In this gameshow styled experience, work together to hunt for loot and internet fame, while escaping before your 7 minutes are up!",
